WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.656 --> 00:00:17.156
be leading the ride," Ms.

2
00:00:17.196 --> 00:00:18.116
Hernandez said.

3
00:00:18.136 --> 00:00:19.797
"Remember, this isn't a race.

4
00:00:20.497 --> 00:00:22.437
Everyone who finishes gets a prize."

5
00:00:23.438 --> 00:00:25.318
"Even if it takes me until tomorrow?"

6
00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:26.538
Cole called out.

7
00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:29.559
Lots of people laughed, including Ms.

8
00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:32.817
Hernandez. "Even then," she said.

9
00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:34.558
"Let's get on the trail!"

10
00:00:34.578 --> 00:00:37.881
"Go, Belltown!"

11
00:00:38.361 --> 00:00:39.442
a blond girl cried.

12
00:00:40.383 --> 00:00:41.744
Henry recognized the girl.

13
00:00:42.405 --> 00:00:45.787
Her name was Melanie, and she was a cheerleader at Belltown High.

14
00:00:46.688 --> 00:00:49.030
Today Melanie wasn't the only person cheering.

15
00:00:49.891 --> 00:00:53.153
Almost everyone let out a whoop as the bikers started down the trail.

16
00:00:57.037 --> 00:01:03.113
Henry was trying to keep up with Cole and Maggie through some pine trees when a shiny mountain

17
00:01:03.153 --> 00:01:04.414
bike rushed in front of him.

18
00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:07.236
"Whoa!" Henry cried.

19
00:01:08.116 --> 00:01:11.279
He braked just in time to keep from crashing into the other bike.

20
00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.261
The rider was about his age.

21
00:01:14.281 --> 00:01:17.903
"Sorry," the boy muttered, glancing back at Henry.

22
00:01:18.804 --> 00:01:20.325
Then he rode ahead quickly.

23
00:01:21.186 --> 00:01:23.247
Henry's friends had heard Henry cry out.

24
00:01:23.908 --> 00:01:26.249
They stopped and turned around to see if he was okay.

25
00:01:26.269 --> 00:01:28.731
"Who was that kid?"

26
00:01:29.091 --> 00:01:29.812
Maggie asked.

27
00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.441
A girl named Daisy overheard her.

28
00:01:32.461 --> 00:01:36.582
"Are you talking about that boy on the fancy mountain bike?"

29
00:01:37.002 --> 00:01:37.562
she asked.

30
00:01:37.582 --> 00:01:39.783
"Yeah," Cole said.

31
00:01:39.803 --> 00:01:41.503
"We didn't recognize him."

32
00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:44.204
"He just moved here," Daisy said.

33
00:01:44.224 --> 00:01:45.964
"His name is William.

34
00:01:46.925 --> 00:01:50.806
My mom told me his family bought a huge house right outside of town."

35
00:01:50.826 --> 00:01:52.726
"How does she know?"

36
00:01:53.207 --> 00:01:53.887
asked Maggie.

37
00:01:53.907 --> 00:01:57.768
"She sells houses for a living," Daisy explained.

38
00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:02.162
A few more riders rode past, including Jill and Ashley.

39
00:02:02.182 --> 00:02:04.043
"Giving up already?"

40
00:02:04.403 --> 00:02:06.765
Jill called out to Henry and the others with a grin.

41
00:02:06.785 --> 00:02:08.766
"No way!"

42
00:02:09.146 --> 00:02:10.047
Cole called back.

43
00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.528
"Come on, guys.

44
00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:12.568
Let's go!"

45
00:02:14.489 --> 00:02:15.250
He raced off.

46
00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.552
Henry and Maggie chased after him, laughing.

47
00:02:20.233 --> 00:02:22.614
All three of them kept riding fast for a while.

48
00:02:23.695 --> 00:02:25.556
Then they slowed down to rest their legs.

49
00:02:26.792 --> 00:02:30.735
Lots of other people were riding slowly too, enjoying the pretty scenery.

50
00:02:30.755 --> 00:02:34.277
"This is fun," Maggie said.

51
00:02:34.298 --> 00:02:36.139
"I'm glad we came."

52
00:02:36.159 --> 00:02:38.901
"Even though it cost you ten dollars?"

53
00:02:39.321 --> 00:02:40.102
Cole teased.

54
00:02:40.122 --> 00:02:43.484
"Maybe more than that," Maggie reminded him.

55
00:02:43.504 --> 00:02:46.346
"With all the lemonade business we lost today!"

56
00:02:47.247 --> 00:02:49.148
Henry laughed, and then looked around.

57
00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:51.530
"Where's Nathan?

58
00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.372
I haven't seen him since we started riding."

59
00:02:55.604 --> 00:02:57.885
"I think he was behind us," Cole said.

60
00:02:57.905 --> 00:02:59.665
"Let's wait for him to catch up."

61
00:03:00.805 --> 00:03:01.866
They stopped their bikes.

62
00:03:03.106 --> 00:03:04.626
Lots of other riders passed them.

63
00:03:05.747 --> 00:03:07.887
Most were smiling or chatting with their friends.

64
00:03:09.108 --> 00:03:10.628
Everyone seemed to be having fun.

65
00:03:12.429 --> 00:03:13.929
Then William rode past again.

66
00:03:14.669 --> 00:03:16.930
He wasn't smiling or talking to anyone.

67
00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:20.991
"He doesn't look like he's having a good time," Cole whispered.

68
00:03:21.891 --> 00:03:22.991
Henry didn't answer.

69
00:03:23.612 --> 00:03:25.132
He'd just spotted Nathan coming.

70
00:03:26.068 --> 00:03:27.389
He wasn't smiling either.

71
00:03:28.009 --> 00:03:31.491
The teenage boy in the Valley High shirt was riding alongside him.

72
00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:33.412
"What's the matter?"

73
00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:35.373
the older boy teased Nathan.

74
00:03:35.393 --> 00:03:37.255
"Can't you keep up?

75
00:03:38.215 --> 00:03:42.217
Is everyone at Belltown High School as slow and lazy as you?"

76
00:03:43.198 --> 00:03:46.139
Henry could tell that Nathan was trying to ignore the bully.

77
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.842
But just then Nathan bumped into a rock on the trail.

78
00:03:50.782 --> 00:03:54.024
His front tire wobbled, and he had to brake suddenly.

79
00:03:56.852 --> 00:03:59.875
"Looks like you're quitting," the bully said with a smirk.

80
00:03:59.895 --> 00:04:02.917
"I guess that makes you a Belltown quitter!"

81
00:04:02.937 --> 00:04:05.199
"Hey!" Cole said.

82
00:04:05.219 --> 00:04:06.641
"Leave him alone!"

83
00:04:07.501 --> 00:04:09.983
Just then three other riders caught up to them.

84
00:04:10.544 --> 00:04:12.526
They all went to Belltown High School.

85
00:04:13.426 --> 00:04:16.989
One was Henry's neighbor, Tiny, the tallest kid in tenth grade.

86
00:04:17.009 --> 00:04:19.071
"What's going on?"

87
00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:20.152
Tiny asked.

88
00:04:20.172 --> 00:04:24.276
"That Valley High kid is bothering Nathan," Maggie said.

89
00:04:25.452 --> 00:04:27.233
The bully heard her and scowled.

90
00:04:27.694 --> 00:04:30.216
"I was just joking around," he muttered.

91
00:04:31.136 --> 00:04:32.598
One of Tiny's friends laughed.

92
00:04:32.618 --> 00:04:37.261
"That makes sense, since Valley High's sports teams are all a big joke."

93
00:04:37.281 --> 00:04:39.223
"They are not!"

94
00:04:39.563 --> 00:04:41.164
the bully retorted angrily.

95
00:04:41.184 --> 00:04:42.885
"Yours are!"

96
00:04:43.746 --> 00:04:45.848
He sped away, still scowling.

97
00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:51.112
The others shrugged and continued the ride.

98
00:04:54.592 --> 00:04:59.756
The trail wound through the woods, up and down hills, and past wildflower meadows.

99
00:05:02.598 --> 00:05:04.820
Finally it widened into a big field.

100
00:05:07.822 --> 00:05:10.303
Many people had already stopped their bikes there.

101
00:05:10.323 --> 00:05:14.006
"This must be the first rest stop," Henry said.

102
00:05:14.567 --> 00:05:16.708
There were two stops planned during the ride.

103
00:05:17.649 --> 00:05:21.852
A local restaurant was providing drinks and snacks for all the riders at each stop.

104
00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:27.563
Henry and the others left their bikes in the field and walked up a narrow hiking trail.

105
00:05:30.945 --> 00:05:34.147
It took about five minutes to reach a picnic area near the river.

106
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.113
For the next half hour, everyone rested and enjoyed the snacks and the view.

107
00:05:44.014 --> 00:05:48.137
Henry sat with Cole, Maggie, Nathan, and some other friends.

108
00:05:51.099 --> 00:05:56.061
He noticed William sitting by himself and wondered if he should invite William to sit with them.

109
00:05:57.001 --> 00:06:00.862
Before Henry could decide, William got up and wandered away.

110
00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:04.643
Finally Ms.

111
00:06:04.683 --> 00:06:07.504
Hernandez announced that it was time to continue the ride.

112
00:06:10.285 --> 00:06:14.006
But when they got back to the bikes, someone let out a cry of surprise.

113
00:06:14.026 --> 00:06:17.467
"I can't believe this!"

114
00:06:17.907 --> 00:06:18.667
Daisy shouted.

115
00:06:18.687 --> 00:06:21.648
"Someone slashed our tires!"
